  "displayedSource": "#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 4;\n    int values[4] = {4, -1, 4, 0};\n    for (int end = n - 1; end > 0; end = end - 1) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < end; j = j + 1) {\n            if (values[j] > values[j + 1]) {\n                int temp = values[j];\n                values[j] = values[j + 1];\n                values[j + 1] = temp;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i = i + 1) {\n        if (i > 0) {\n            printf(\" \");\n        }\n        printf(\"%d\", values[i]);\n    }\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n",
